<#    FormuLang Stock    ##
---------------------------
Simple Moving Average (SMA)
---------------------------
Indicator by:
  R. H. Hooker
Script by:
  A. Piznal
---------------------------
Desctiption:
  Simple Moving Average is
  common indicator for
  predicting the trend by
  averaging close values.
---------------------------
Parameters:
  - period - indicates the
    candle window size
------------------------ #> 

REQUIRE "stock-1.0+"

$period = PARAMETERS.period
$skip = I < $period

IF($skip, null, AVG(RANGE(CLOSE, I - $period, I)))
